@baseUrl = http://localhost:5020
@roomId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### List rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms

### List rooms available in a window
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms?start=2026-10-03T09:00:00Z&end=2026-10-03T10:00:00Z

### List room reservations with paging defaults overridden
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/reservations?start=2026-10-03T00:00:00Z&end=2026-10-04T00:00:00Z&limit=25&offset=0

### Create reservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "2026-10-03T09:00:00Z",
  "end": "2026-10-03T10:00:00Z",
  "title": "Engineering Standup"
}

### Conflict example (overlapping reservation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": "2026-10-03T09:30:00Z",
  "end": "2026-10-03T10:30:00Z",
  "title": "Overlapping meeting"
}

### Conditional GET example (If-None-Match)
# Copy the ETag value returned by the previous GET response.
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms?start=2026-10-03T09:00:00Z&end=2026-10-03T10:00:00Z
If-None-Match: W/"paste-etag-from-previous-response"
